{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Dataset","@id":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V","identifier":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V","name":"Parsed DMOZ data","creator":[{"@type":"Person","givenName":"Gaurav","familyName":"Sood","name":"Sood, Gaurav"}],"author":[{"@type":"Person","givenName":"Gaurav","familyName":"Sood","name":"Sood, Gaurav"}],"datePublished":"2016-06-13","dateModified":"2021-02-18","version":"4","description":"DMOZ is a large communally maintained open directory that categorizes web content. The data are posted in a complex XML format. The python scripts posted here were used to parse the data posted at: http://rdf.dmoz.org/ on June 12, 2016 to produce a csv file posted here. The structure of the file is \"URL\",\"Category 1\",\"Category 2\",.......... Given the categories are separated by commas, doing read_csv without the right options can be problematic Here's some code to read in the file: https://gist.github.com/soodoku/a97e6cf2800429d1c541ac2fb65e4c98","keywords":["Social Sciences"],"license":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0","includedInDataCatalog":{"@type":"DataCatalog","name":"Harvard Dataverse","url":"https://dataverse.harvard.edu"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Harvard Dataverse"},"provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Harvard Dataverse"},"distribution":[{"@type":"DataDownload","name":"dmoz_domain_category.tab","encodingFormat":"text/tab-separated-values","contentSize":296615966,"@id":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/DSJVXA","identifier":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/DSJVXA","contentUrl":"https://dataverse.harvard.edu/api/access/datafile/2914111"},{"@type":"DataDownload","name":"parsed-domain.csv.7z","encodingFormat":"application/x-7z-compressed","contentSize":44122039,"description":"Parsed domain level data","@id":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/CUVWF4","identifier":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/CUVWF4","contentUrl":"https://dataverse.harvard.edu/api/access/datafile/2847112"},{"@type":"DataDownload","name":"parsed-subdomain.csv.7z","encodingFormat":"application/x-7z-compressed","contentSize":48035564,"description":"Subdomains","@id":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/CTZU8K","identifier":"https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/OMV93V/CTZU8K","contentUrl":"https://dataverse.harvard.edu/api/access/datafile/2841558"}]}